  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MENA - NORCAP secondments</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MENA - humanitarian activities. NORCAP (Norwegian Capacity Standby Roster). Secondment of personell on short notice to the United Nation and other organisations strengthening their capacity to efficiently protect lives and livelihood of affected populations in crisis. The grant recipient shall be familiar with UN Security Council Resolution 1325 on women, peace and security and implement the project in a way that promotes the intentions of the resolution in the best possible way.</narrative>
  </description>
